  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============================================================
     HERO
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="il-hero">
  <div class="il-hero__inner">
    <div class="il-hero__text">
      <h1 class="il-hero__headline">
        Secure the <span class="il-accent">Data Layer</span><br />
        of Zero Trust
      </h1>
      <p class="il-hero__sub">
        80% of all corporate data is unstructured — identity locked,
        network locked, application locked. The data itself remains wide open.
        It's time to close that gap.
      </p>
      <div class="il-hero__actions">
        <a href="#" class="il-btn-pill il-btn-pill--lg">Learn more</a>
        <a href="#" class="il-link-arrow">Watch the film
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="il-hero__dots" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="active"></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="il-hero__visual" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="il-hero__visual-inner">
        <div class="il-hero__glow"></div>
        <div class="il-hero__shard"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     LOGO STRIP
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="il-logos" aria-label="Trusted by">
  <div class="il-logos__inner">
    <p class="il-logos__caption">Trusted by security leaders</p>
    <div class="il-logos__row">
      <img src="/images/Illumio-logo-grey.webp" alt="Illumio" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <img src="/images/zscaler-logo-grey.webp" alt="Zscaler" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <img src="https://fileflex.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Cisco-logo-grey.png.webp" alt="Cisco" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <img src="https://fileflex.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Palo-Alto-logo-grey.png.webp" alt="Palo Alto Networks" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <img src="/images/Microsoft-logo-grey.webp" alt="Microsoft" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <img src="https://fileflex.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/cloudfare.webp" alt="Cloudflare" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     THE GAP — PROBLEM / SOLUTION
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="il-gap">
  <div class="il-gap__inner">
    <p class="il-eyebrow">The Zero Trust Data Gap</p>
    <h2 class="il-section-title">
      Hackers don't steal your network.<br />
      <span class="il-accent">They steal your data.</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="il-gap__grid">
      <article class="il-card">
        <p class="il-card__label">The problem</p>
        <h3 class="il-card__title">Today's Zero Trust stops at identity, networks, and applications.</h3>
        <p class="il-card__body">
          Unstructured data — the files where your IP and regulated information
          actually live — sits outside that perimeter. It's the last unprotected
          surface.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="il-card il-card--filled">
        <p class="il-card__label">The solution</p>
        <h3 class="il-card__title">Zero Trust Data Access completes the strategy in the data layer.</h3>
        <p class="il-card__body">
          Least-privilege, just-in-time, fully governed access applied directly
          to files wherever they reside — without moving them, without VPNs,
          without migration.
        </p>
        <a href="#" class="il-link-arrow il-link-arrow--light">Read the brief
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     MEET FILEFLEX
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="il-meet">
  <div class="il-meet__inner">
    <p class="il-eyebrow">Meet FileFlex Enterprise</p>
    <h2 class="il-section-title">
      An easy-to-implement overlay service that applies Zero Trust Data Access to the data layer.
    </h2>
    <div class="il-meet__grid">
      <div>
        <h3 class="il-meet__kicker">What it is</h3>
        <ul class="il-meet__list">
          <li><strong>FileFlex Enterprise</strong> is a data security and productivity platform that overlays your existing infrastructure. It federates access across on-premises, cloud, SharePoint, FTP, and NAS storage, enforcing Zero Trust Data Access without migration.</li>
          <li>Overlay service for hybrid data storage environments</li>
          <li>Zero Trust enforcement at the unstructured data layer</li>
          <li>Secure access, sharing, and collaboration without data duplication</li>
          <li>Supports Virtual Data Rooms, large file access, and legacy system integration</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="il-meet__kicker">Zero Trust Access for Unstructured Data</h3>
        <ul class="il-meet__list il-meet__list--tight">
          <li><strong>Built for Zero Trust Data.</strong> A true Zero Trust platform and modern replacement for VPNs.</li>
          <li><strong>Access data, not infrastructure.</strong> Users see only the files they're authorized to use — nothing more.</li>
          <li><strong>Data never moves.</strong> No copying, syncing, or migration. Lower costs. No data sprawl.</li>
          <li><strong>End-to-end encrypted.</strong> In transit, never at rest outside the source.</li>
          <li><strong>Full visibility and auditability.</strong> Real-time logging of every file transaction, anywhere.</li>
          <li><strong>Plug-and-play Windows integration.</strong> Driver-level Zero Trust Data Access.</li>
          <li><strong>Total control. Fast deployment.</strong> Centralized control — installed in a day.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="il-meet__cta">
      <a href="#" class="il-btn-pill il-btn-pill--lg">Learn more</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

