        </div>
        <h4>Zero Trust Virtual Data Rooms</h4>
        <p>Governed environments for mortgage approvals, M&amp;A, and any workflow that demands an auditable chain of access.</p>
        <a href="#" class="il-link-arrow">Read more
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </a>
      </article>
      <article class="il-feature">
        <div class="il-feature__icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h10"/><circle cx="19" cy="17" r="2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>FTP / MFP Replacement</h4>
        <p>Modernize legacy file-transfer systems with secure, policy-driven Zero Trust Data Access.</p>
        <a href="#" class="il-link-arrow">Read more
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
