        </div>
        <h4>Regulatory Compliance</h4>
        <p>Least-privilege access + detailed audit trails aligned to GDPR, HIPAA, DORA, FFIEC, GLBA, NIST, and CMMC.</p>
        <a href="#" class="il-link-arrow">Read more
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </a>
      </article>
      <article class="il-feature">
        <div class="il-feature__icon il-feature__icon--filled">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Federated Hybrid Access</h4>
        <p>Single-pane access to files across on-premises, private cloud, legacy systems, and remote offices — no migration, no VPNs.</p>
        <a href="#" class="il-link-arrow">Read more
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
